{"name":"Del Rio","hex":"#b5998e","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Del Rio","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A census-designated place in Stanislaus County, California, United States.","An unincorporated community in Hillsborough County, Florida, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Del_Rio"}],"entries":[{"title":"Del Rio, California","blocks":[{"text":"Del Rio is an unincorporated community in Stanislaus County, California, United States that is located around the Del Rio Country Club. The population was 1,399 at the 2020 census, up from 1,270 at the 2010 census. For statistical purposes, the United States Census Bureau has defined the community as a census-designated place (CDP). It is part of the Modesto Metropolitan Statistical Area."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Stanislaus_County_California_Incorporated_and_Unincorporated_areas_Del_Rio_Highlighted.svg/330px-Stanislaus_County_California_Incorporated_and_Unincorporated_areas_Del_Rio_Highlighted.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Del_Rio%2C_California"},{"title":"Del Rio, Florida","blocks":[{"text":"Del Rio is an unincorporated, urban community in Hillsborough County, Florida, United States. It lies between Tampa and Temple Terrace, near the Hillsborough River."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Del_Rio%2C_Florida"},{"title":"Del","blocks":[{"text":"Del, or nabla, is an operator used in mathematics as a vector differential operator, usually represented by ∇. When applied to a function defined on a one-dimensional domain, it denotes the standard derivative of the function as defined in calculus. When applied to a field, it may denote any one of three operations depending on the way it is applied: the gradient or (locally) steepest slope of a scalar field ; the divergence of a vector field; or the curl (rotation) of a vector field."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Del"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey bucchero-ware bowl, Clay, 1000-700 BCE, Nr. Babakõy, Turkey, Fitzwilliam Museum, Cambridge","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Grey_bucchero-ware_bowl%2C_Clay%2C_1000-700_BCE%2C_Nr._Babak%C3%B5y%2C_Turkey%2C_Fitzwilliam_Museum%2C_Cambridge.jpg/500px-Grey_bucchero-ware_bowl%2C_Clay%2C_1000-700_BCE%2C_Nr._Babak%C3%B5y%2C_Turkey%2C_Fitzwilliam_Museum%2C_Cambridge.jpg","ratio":0.8,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_bucchero-ware_bowl,_Clay,_1000-700_BCE,_Nr._Babak%C3%B5y,_Turkey,_Fitzwilliam_Museum,_Cambridge.jpg","share":0.58375},{"title":"Scala di grigi","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Scala_di_grigi.jpg/500px-Scala_di_grigi.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Scala_di_grigi.jpg","share":0.325},{"title":"Revised Federal Building in Del Rio, TX DSCN1428","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Revised_Federal_Building_in_Del_Rio%2C_TX_DSCN1428.JPG/500px-Revised_Federal_Building_in_Del_Rio%2C_TX_DSCN1428.JPG","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Revised_Federal_Building_in_Del_Rio,_TX_DSCN1428.JPG","share":0.308125},{"title":"Grey-breasted mountain toucan (Andigena hypoglauca) Caldas","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Grey-breasted_mountain_toucan_%28Andigena_hypoglauca%29_Caldas.jpg/500px-Grey-breasted_mountain_toucan_%28Andigena_hypoglauca%29_Caldas.jpg","ratio":0.7726960896409787,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey-breasted_mountain_toucan_(Andigena_hypoglauca)_Caldas.jpg","share":0.264375},{"title":"Grey Carpet from above","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg/500px-Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gre